idden="true">Evaluate mouse models for our next study. Compare candidates to historical study results, flag models we&#x27;ve already tested, and recommend which to prioritize.</p><p style="opacity:1;transform:none">Build me a foundry for antibody discovery. Include agents to generate sequences, plan cloning, coordinate lab work, analyze</p></div></div><div class="HomeHero_actions__i_Yto"><button type="button" class="HomeHero_copyButton__7GZP0"><svg width="27" height="27" viewBox="0 0 27 27" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="HomeHero_copyIcon__jDijP" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18.9107 7.31671V4.19833C18.9107 2.43194 17.4787 1 15.7123 1H4.19833C2.43194 1 1 2.43194 1 4.19834V15.7123C1 17.4787 2.43194 18.9107 4.19833 18.9107H7.11681" stroke="#867AF2" stroke-width="2"></path><rect x="7.27539" y="7.31641" width="17.9107" height="17.9107" rx="3.19833" stroke="#867AF2" stroke-width="2"></rect></svg><span aria-live="polite">Copy</span></button><a class="HomeHero_sendButton__kaymf" href="/science-foundries-inquiry">Build your Science Foundry<svg preserveAspectRatio="none" overflow="visible" style="display:block" width="20.9997" height="20.9997" viewBox="0 0 20.9997 20.9997" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="HomeHero_sendIcon__zqXtX" aria-hidden="true"><g id="I/level-up-arrow"><path id="Combined-Shape" d="M17.006 8.14671C16.4934 8.65927 15.6624 8.65927 15.1498 8.14671L11.4842 4.48109L11.4842 19.9845C11.4842 20.4678 11.0925 20.8595 10.6092 20.8595H9.73423C9.25099 20.8595 8.85925 20.4678 8.85925 19.9845V4.48109L5.19363 8.14671C4.68107 8.65927 3.85005 8.65927 3.3375 8.14671C2.82494 7.63415 2.82494 6.80314 3.3375 6.29058L9.24366 0.384417C9.43587 0.192207 9.67286 0.0720787 9.92105 0.0240269C10.2549 -0.0406189 10.6091 0.0251884 10.9017 0.221445C10.9754 0.271324 17.006 6.29058 17.006 6.29058C17.5185 6.80314 17.5185 7.63415 17.006 8.14671Z" fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" fill="white"></path></g></svg></a></div></div></div></div></div